      "value": "Heyo, this is happening for me too, I wanted to add that it's happening when sitting as well, my avatar stays in the place of the chair but the feet continue to move, tested in room of the rain in those grab-able chairs. I have mostly default locomotion except I changed the animations for prone to a different sit animation. Edit: also happening when in main menu as well, where the feet would be locked to the ground before, they aren't locked and my whole body moves when using space drag in menu. This is all in VR mode.",
