      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name}: can i make a suggestion? Since it needs fixing anyway, can we get a Parameter (Bool) to turn on/off auto footstep during playing? I am asking specifically for a bool here, since during creating the locomotion layers you have cases where you want to enable/disable auto footsteps. Currently we can disable/enable it on avatar basis, but while I want them in half body, i would love to be able to turn them off in desktop, since the auto footstep IK strongly disagrees with standing poses in desktop where the hip is tilted or the feet moved differently (attaching picture of a custom pose i would love to have in desktop, but with auto footsteps on sadly a no-go.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
